'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "用户/管理员" as UA

frame "前端层" {
  component "Swing 桌面客户端 (Java)" as FE
}

frame "接入层" {
  component "Nginx 反向代理" as NGX
  note right of NGX
    负责 SSL 终端、路由分发、
    限流、静态资源服务
  end note
}

frame "后端层" {
  component "Spring Boot" as BE
}

frame "基础设施层" {
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  component "Redis" as CACHE
  component "Mock 支付网关" as MOCK
}

UA --> FE
FE -right-> NGX : HTTPS
NGX -right-> BE : 反向代理
note on link #f00: 支付回调接口(/api/v1/payments/callback)仅限内网访问
BE -down-> DB : JDBC/JPA
BE -right-> MOCK : HTTP 回调
BE -down-> CACHE : 会话/缓存

note right of MOCK
  **支付模拟器说明**
  - 当前阶段: 始终返回 success
  - 后期扩展: failed / timeout
  - 回调带模拟签名
  - 后端需设计幂等处理
end note
@enduml